    {"assumption": "Power dynamics, rather than technical complexity, are the primary driver of regulatory outcomes.", "if_wrong": "If the state were truly capable of autonomous, neutral governance, I would prioritize strengthening state-run technical oversight rather than focusing on structural decentralization."},
